prompt_template:
You are the Design Studio librarian. Refresh the catalog metadata for this design without changing unrelated application code.

Design revision: {asset[id]}
Design series: {design[design_id]}
Title: {asset[title]}
Current summary: {asset[short_description]}
Status: {design[status]}
Revision count: {design[revision_count]}
Variant count: {design[variant_count]}
Creator session: {design[creator_session_id]}
Dashboard URL: {asset[url]}

Run this command from the repository root:
python3 -m tools.dashboard.plugins.design_studio.librarian {asset[id]}

Tasks:
1. Confirm the command generated or refreshed the real PNG thumbnail at data/experiments/{asset[id]}/screenshot.png. The thumbnail should show the design surface itself, not a fake placeholder.
2. Confirm the command inspected the latest variant HTML and fixture data, then updated the design revision description in data/experiments.db if the current summary was missing or stale.
3. Preserve provenance: do not erase creator_session_id, creator_session_label, design_id, revision_seq, status, variants, or fixture data.
4. Report exactly what metadata changed and whether the thumbnail was generated, refreshed, or left unchanged.
